{"ref":"BDB, צָרָה²","hw":"צָרָה²","html":"I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צָרָה</span></big><sub>72</sub>  <strong>n.f. id.</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.24\">1 S 26:24</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרָ֫תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 120:1\" href=\"/Psalms.120.1\">ψ 120:1</a> (Ges<sup>§ 90 g</sup>); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:21\" href=\"/Genesis.42.21\">Gn 42:21</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:3\" href=\"/Genesis.35.3\">35:3</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרַתְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:14\" href=\"/Judges.10.14\">Ju 10:14</a>, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרוֹת</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.16\">Is 65:16</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.19\">1 S 10:19</a>, etc.;—<em>straits, distress</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:21\" href=\"/Genesis.42.21\">Gn 42:21</a> (E); <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.24\">1 S 26:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.9\">2 S 4:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.29\">1 K 1:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.22\">Is 8:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 5:19\" href=\"/Job.5.19\">Jb 5:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:9\" href=\"/Job.27.9\">27:9</a>; especially ψψ (24 times), e.g. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:12\" href=\"/Psalms.22.12\">22:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:17\" href=\"/Psalms.25.17\">25:17</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָחַב\" href=\"/BDB,_רָחַב\", dir=\"rtl\">רחב</a>), v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:22\" href=\"/Psalms.25.22\">22</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:8\" href=\"/Psalms.31.8\">31:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:17\" href=\"/Psalms.34.17\">34:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:18\" href=\"/Psalms.34.18\">18</a>; specif. of travail, <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרָה וַחֲבָלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.24\">Je 49:24</a> (sim.), cf. <a data-